{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"mediaId":34773,"seasonNumber":1},"checkedAt":1793471467112,"status":"ok","retryCount":0,"value":{"seasonNumber":1,"name":{"value":"Stagione 1","language":"it-IT"},"year":2008,"episodeCount":26,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/f613eSgVKsfVmNrqQcSOHEpxMdK.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"episodes":[{"id":"791991","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":1,"title":{"value":"Episodio 1","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Construction of an artificial island is disrupted by an unexplained phenomenon known as \"burning sea\". Masamichi Haru is injured by burning sea during a test of early Meta-Real technology, leaving him comatose for fifty years. Now elderly and wheelchair-bound, he still hopes to solve the mystery of burning sea. His friend Eichiro Kushima now hopes to use the Meta-Real, also known as the Metal, to research the burning sea phenomenon.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2008-04-09","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gEqEpDOT55n6mbsQiWZpGBjsoXD.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gEqEpDOT55n6mbsQiWZpGBjsoXD.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34773/season/1/episode/1"},{"id":"791992","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":2,"title":{"value":"Episodio 2","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Aoi Minamo is hired to be Haru's assistant. When burning sea causes a power outage that threatens life support systems on the artificial island, Minamo rushes to the electrical substation, while Haru uses his cyberbrain to dive into the Metal Network.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2008-04-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5x9b5aBUl4dX9QqxNFuw8YBouCD.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5x9b5aBUl4dX9QqxNFuw8YBouCD.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34773/season/1/episode/2"},{"id":"791993","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":3,"title":{"value":"Episodio 3","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Haru struggles to become proficient enough at Metal diving to help Kushima's research. During his final test, he experiences braindown.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2008-04-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iizhqtXYCW1vrip7PJTPaMwMZPN.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iizhqtXYCW1vrip7PJTPaMwMZPN.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34773/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"791994","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Haru has become an official investigator and is asked to dive into the Metal to rescue the consciousness of an Artificial Island shareholder who has experienced braindown.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2008-04-30","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hgU85GNOwTZfxA6KMbFcEM9lMZ2.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hgU85GNOwTZfxA6KMbFcEM9lMZ2.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34773/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"791995","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Minamo searches for a pair of antique Sous-Marin sunglasses as a gift to congratulate Haru on becoming an official investigator. During the search, Minamo and Sota have a run-in with champion fighter Iron Schwartz.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2008-05-07","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/f3QPEZcVGT2H2T8P0dKGXDXnKmc.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/f3QPEZcVGT2H2T8P0dKGXDXnKmc.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34773/season/1/episode/5"},{"id":"791996","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Because of her lack of a cyberbrain to read online texts, Minamo must find a physical book for a book report. Her discovery reveals the true story of a lost love.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2008-05-14","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uuuLMlXvkWJUKam2iSIxhPZgAK8.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uuuLMlXvkWJUKam2iSIxhPZgAK8.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34773/season/1/episode/6"},{"id":"791997","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Minamo and Haru discover a dog whose consciousness was swapped with that of his owner. They hurry to find the owner's body before it becomes too late for them to switch them back.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2008-05-21","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fSu4lwiDs7VsoodcQlxExlDrzka.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fSu4lwiDs7VsoodcQlxExlDrzka.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34773/season/1/episode/7"},{"id":"791998","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Minamo and Sota investigate reports of ghost sightings at Minamo's school.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2008-05-28","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3eTuv8vaaw3B0YXVozBvsjk0wGn.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3eTuv8vaaw3B0YXVozBvsjk0wGn.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34773/season/1/episode/8"},{"id":"791999","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Episodio 9","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Minamo and Sota's father shuts down the core server to minimize damage from a virus intrusion, putting his job on the line.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2008-06-04","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rMz7B2b5DG0pUaynHULnVFIAQ42.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rMz7B2b5DG0pUaynHULnVFIAQ42.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34773/season/1/episode/9"},{"id":"792000","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Those who contact a mysterious oracle in the Metal named Eliza end up with lost memories. During the investigation, Minamo realizes that Haru has been talking to none other than Eliza.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2008-06-11","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fE10jMUsNw1DiFFBZzta1iqEfig.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fE10jMUsNw1DiFFBZzta1iqEfig.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34773/season/1/episode/10"},{"id":"792001","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Minamo tries to help violinist Ichinose, who has been discouraged ever since Kushima suddenly quit playing violin long ago.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2008-06-18","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oYAy3IGh9jVfzTp9RVxnWR5doqG.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oYAy3IGh9jVfzTp9RVxnWR5doqG.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34773/season/1/episode/11"},{"id":"792002","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Episodio 12","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Minamo meets Amy, a girl who has just received cybernetic eyes to cure her blindness, but learns that Amy is struggling to adjust to being able to see. Meanwhile, Haru is asked to investigate the disappearance of a highly sought-after artist in the Metal.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2008-06-25","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/u21zaeSIP4G5cYFiurVtT41yECG.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u21zaeSIP4G5cYFiurVtT41yECG.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34773/season/1/episode/12"},{"id":"792003","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":13,"title":{"value":"Episodio 13","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Haru reminisces about his youth, from his parents' struggles with poverty that led to trouble with the yakuza, to his meeting a dolphin that inspired his fascination with the sea, and finally to his exploration of the ruins of his city, now underwater because of climate change, which led him to become a test diver for early Meta-Real experiments.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2008-07-02","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/41GqjXGY13VcFgkqpl2MJ38tqI4.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/41GqjXGY13VcFgkqpl2MJ38tqI4.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34773/season/1/episode/13"},{"id":"792004","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":14,"title":{"value":"Episodio 14","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Minamo goes for a dive in the sea. This episode is a recap of the series so far.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2008-07-09","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/80zlpJ7WCiyAggqftWavLv5uQ11.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/80zlpJ7WCiyAggqftWavLv5uQ11.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34773/season/1/episode/14"},{"id":"792005","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":15,"title":{"value":"Episodio 15","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Haru investigates cyberbrain deterioration in a group of food connoisseurs.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2008-07-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ij3BJ5GOL2iQWYeVUVa9BvNdjbP.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ij3BJ5GOL2iQWYeVUVa9BvNdjbP.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34773/season/1/episode/15"},{"id":"792006","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":16,"title":{"value":"Episodio 16","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Sota tries to train enough to defeat Holon in battle. Meanwhile, Haru investigates a case of a female android being illegally used for prostitution.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2008-07-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gGcKXRNyKdYUftbTLGO5i5hfMUE.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gGcKXRNyKdYUftbTLGO5i5hfMUE.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34773/season/1/episode/16"},{"id":"792007","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":17,"title":{"value":"Episodio 17","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Minamo's family comes to visit.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2008-07-30","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/snFNgLXx7rvjB0DdyRFD2DhmmpV.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/snFNgLXx7rvjB0DdyRFD2DhmmpV.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34773/season/1/episode/17"},{"id":"792008","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":18,"title":{"value":"Episodio 18","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Haru, Minamo, Sota, and Holon go to a distant jungle island to investigate a mysterious background noise in the Metal. All seems well until ionization in the rainforest disrupts Holon's cyberbrain.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2008-08-06","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vJ4G8qwamS0I8rZB2Tw1ZLWbeqk.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vJ4G8qwamS0I8rZB2Tw1ZLWbeqk.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34773/season/1/episode/18"},{"id":"792009","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":19,"title":{"value":"Episodio 19","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Holon collapses, and the others attempt to complete their investigation without her help.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2008-08-13","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yl66CTOs1SeUiKHQndI6FmtWhVI.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yl66CTOs1SeUiKHQndI6FmtWhVI.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34773/season/1/episode/19"},{"id":"792010","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":20,"title":{"value":"Episodio 20","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"At the jungle island, Haru realized that he can learn to walk again, and he begins to practice in secret to avoid jeopardizing his job as a Metal diver. Meanwhile, Minamo gets tested for suitability to receive a cyberbrain.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2008-08-20","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7hRGX9HCNko0kxrj7sNv7zYp1t5.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7hRGX9HCNko0kxrj7sNv7zYp1t5.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34773/season/1/episode/20"},{"id":"792011","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":21,"title":{"value":"Episodio 21","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Following the success of weather particle experimentation, the Secretary-General and Jeni En want to install weather particle plants as soon as possible. Kushima is opposed to the plan, suspecting that the weather particles will cause complications that threaten the Artificial Island. Meanwhile, Sota goes on a date with Holon.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2008-08-27","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ot4XzDgPDIiOr1SeGOSyxaG69br.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ot4XzDgPDIiOr1SeGOSyxaG69br.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34773/season/1/episode/21"},{"id":"792012","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":22,"title":{"value":"Episodio 22","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Kushima goes missing, and is later found without his cyberbrain. Brain death will occur within twelve hours, so Sota and Holon search for his cyberbrain while Haru searches the Metal for his consciousness. Meanwhile, with Kushima missing from the Trustee meeting, the Secretary-General has no choice but to approve Jeni En's motion to begin bringing the weather particle plants online.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2008-09-03","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mPJmH24MAxSbpMcjHxSoD38tn2t.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mPJmH24MAxSbpMcjHxSoD38tn2t.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34773/season/1/episode/22"},{"id":"792013","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":23,"title":{"value":"Episodio 23","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"With help from the Secretary-General, Sota deciphers the clues to bringing Kushima's cyberbrain back online, but instead of Kushima, an emergency AI awakens. The AI explains Kushima's suspicion that the weather particles cause the burning sea phenomenon, convincing the Secretary-General to halt weather particle production until Kushima can prove his theory. However, Jeni En temporarily revokes the Secretary-General's authority with a vote of no confidence.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2008-09-10","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rMP5CkisESYJ6dMweVnv5vWUtUv.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rMP5CkisESYJ6dMweVnv5vWUtUv.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34773/season/1/episode/23"},{"id":"792014","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":24,"title":{"value":"Episodio 24","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Sota breaks into the weather particle facility with help from Haru in the Metal, but before he can reach the control room where the weather particle launch can be halted, Sota must fight Jeni En.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2008-09-17","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fRl6Egdr3JCNfEVW1BVj2ICvk6g.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fRl6Egdr3JCNfEVW1BVj2ICvk6g.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34773/season/1/episode/24"},{"id":"792015","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":25,"title":{"value":"Episodio 25","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"After the spread of weather particles, drastic weather changes occur across the planet, and the burning sea phenomenon returns. Haru decides to use the experimental deep dive suit in an attempt to make contact with Kushima.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2008-09-24","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/v7sEZ0F6wt6Sz9a3dYVSCGFY7g2.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/v7sEZ0F6wt6Sz9a3dYVSCGFY7g2.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34773/season/1/episode/25"},{"id":"792016","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":26,"title":{"value":"Episodio 26","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Haru makes contact with Eliza and receives Kushima's proof that the weather particles will cause worldwide disaster. Haru broadcasts the proof on the Metal, and the world's leaders quickly agree to shut down the Metal to kill the weather particle nanomachines. Kushima's consciousness then contacts Haru and explains that the ocean itself will replace the functionality of Metal via the salt water in the human body. Haru, restored to his younger self, is safely returned to the surface, where he reunites with Minamo.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2008-10-01","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/89XARxQHjmiu8GBdEkgoaR0440F.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/89XARxQHjmiu8GBdEkgoaR0440F.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34773/season/1/episode/26"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34773/season/1"},"failure":null,"fields":{},"episodes":{"1":{"checkedAt":1793471467112,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"2":{"checkedAt":1793471467112,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"3":{"checkedAt":1793471467112,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"4":{"checkedAt":1793471467112,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"5":{"checkedAt":1793471467112,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"6":{"checkedAt":1793471467112,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"7":{"checkedAt":1793471467112,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"8":{"checkedAt":1793471467112,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"9":{"checkedAt":1793471467112,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"10":{"checkedAt":1793471467112,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"11":{"checkedAt":1793471467112,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"12":{"checkedAt":1793471467112,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"13":{"checkedAt":1793471467112,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"14":{"checkedAt":1793471467112,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"15":{"checkedAt":1793471467112,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"16":{"checkedAt":1793471467112,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"17":{"checkedAt":1793471467112,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"18":{"checkedAt":1793471467112,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"19":{"checkedAt":1793471467112,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"20":{"checkedAt":1793471467112,